00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:34.020
The target is plus 3% to plus 7% over the five-session window.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:39.660
Confidence is medium because two factors are aligned with one uncertainty around sector rotation.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:45.520
The setup tests whether a valuation screen can identify names that have already reset expectations.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:55.200
Listeners can replicate the screen by sorting TSX software names for forward revenue growth above 10% and enterprise value to sales below 3.

