00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:41.500
in a TFSA or non-registered account that have declined more than 5% from their adjusted

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:47.020
cost base. It surfaces replacement candidates in the same sector to maintain exposure while

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:53.380
realizing the loss. Canadian investors with more than $25,000 in taxable accounts should

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:58.700
run the scan quarterly before year end. The tool helps avoid the permanent loss of contribution

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:04.820
room that occurs when losses are realized inside a TFSA. The broker's option chain displays

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:11.020
real-time bid-ask spreads and implied volatility for every strike and expiry. Users can filter

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:16.520
for contracts with volume above the 20-day average before writing covered calls. This reduces

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:20.320
slippage compared with retail platforms that show only end-of-day data.

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:25.740
The platform also supports direct access to dark pool and options flow data when paired

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.800
